Hackathon notice: this is an unofficial prototype built for the Paytm AI
Hackathon (Hyderabad, Theme 2 — AI for Small Businesses). It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or shipped by Paytm. Payment authorisation, settlements and
supplier payouts are simulated. Do not use this software to move real money
unless you point a real UPI VPA at the QR and understand that the in-app
ledger still does not talk to Paytm or a bank.
